# The 122 MB parquet must never be published — the site reads it from R2.
# data/static.json DOES get published: index.html fetches it directly for a
# fast first paint while DuckDB-WASM boots. A bare `data/` here excludes the
# directory, and gitignore syntax cannot re-include a file underneath an
# excluded directory, so exclude the parquet specifically.
data/*.parquet
test_server.py
tests/
.wrangler/
node_modules/

# R2 bucket CORS policy — infrastructure config, applied with
# `wrangler r2 bucket cors set`. Nothing serves it.
r2-cors.json

# `vercel --prod` uploads the working tree, not the committed one, so anything
# sitting in here goes live whether or not it was ever committed. These two are
# untracked work-in-progress from May, unlinked from the index and 404 in
# production — keep it that way until they are deliberately finished. Delete
# these lines to publish them.
hiring.html
api/hiring_stats.py
